      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "很多中国人都说：“又一首神曲诞生了！”",
      "traditional": "很多中國人都說：“又一首神曲誕生了！”",
      "pinyin": "hěn duō zhōng guó rén dōu shuō yòu yì shǒu shén qǔ dàn shēng le",
      "english": "Recently, the song PPAP (Pen Pinapple Apple Pen) went viral in China and abroad."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A lot of Chinese people say: “Yet another divine song has been born!”"
    },
