      "pinyin": "shén qǔ shì shén me ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "在中国，神曲一般指的是一些节奏简单，容易上口，而且流传较广的歌曲。",
      "traditional": "在中國，神曲一般指的是一些節奏簡單，容易上口，而且流傳較廣的歌曲。",
      "pinyin": "zài zhōng guó shén qǔ yì bān zhǐ de shì yì xiē jié zòu jiǎn dān róng yì shàng kǒu ér qiě liú chuán jiào guǎng de gē qǔ",
      "english": "So what is a divine song?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "这种歌曲一般在你重复听了几遍后，旋律就会在你脑海里挥之不去，",
      "traditional": "這種歌曲一般在你重複聽了幾遍後，旋律就會在你腦海裡揮之不去，",
      "pinyin": "zhè zhǒng gē qǔ yì bān zài nǐ chóng fù tīng le jǐ biàn hòu xuán lǜ jiù huì zài nǐ nǎo hǎi lǐ huī zhī bú qù",
      "english": "In China, divine song generally refers to an easy to remember song with simple rhythms, that is widely spread."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "你会不自觉地哼唱它，有点像“洗脑”的感觉。",
      "traditional": "你會不自覺地哼唱它，有點像“洗腦”的感覺。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ huì bú zì jué de hēng chàng tā yǒu diǎn xiàng xǐ nǎo de gǎn jué",
      "english": "The melodies from these songs often get stuck on your mind after hearing them a few times."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You might start humming them unconsciously, and it feels a bit like you have been brainwashed."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "中国有很多被大家称为“神曲”的歌曲。",
      "traditional": "中國有很多被大家稱為“神曲”的歌曲。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó yǒu hěn duō bèi dà jiā chēng wéi shén qǔ de gē qǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "比如，《小苹果》、《最炫民族风》、《爱情买卖》等。",
      "traditional": "比如，《小蘋果》、《最炫民族風》、《愛情買賣》等。",
      "pinyin": "bǐ rú xiǎo píng guǒ zuì xuàn mín zú fēng ài qíng mǎi mài děng",
      "english": "In China there are a lot of songs that have been named “divine songs”."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "有人觉得这些歌曲旋律单一，歌词很俗、很土。",
      "traditional": "有人覺得這些歌曲旋律單一，歌詞很俗、很土。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu rén jué de zhè xiē gē qǔ xuán lǜ dān yī gē cí hěn sú hěn tǔ",
      "english": "For example, “Xiao Ping Guo”, “Zui Xuan Min Zu Feng”, “Ai Qing Mai Mai”, etc."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "也有人觉得这些歌曲很亲民，而且不容易跑调。",
      "traditional": "也有人覺得這些歌曲很親民，而且不容易跑調。",
      "pinyin": "yě yǒu rén jué de zhè xiē gē qǔ hěn qīn mín ér qiě bù róng yì pǎo diào",
      "english": "Some people think these songs are repetitive with plain, boring lyrics."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Others think these songs feel familiar, and are easy to sing along with."
    }
