    "sentence_translations": [
      "Divine Songs in China",
      "",
      "Recently, the song PPAP (Pen Pinapple Apple Pen) went viral in China and abroad.",
      "A lot of Chinese people say: “Yet another divine song has been born!”",
      "",
      "So what is a divine song?",
      "In China, divine song generally refers to an easy to remember song with simple rhythms, that is widely spread.",
      "The melodies from these songs often get stuck on your mind after hearing them a few times.",
      "You might start humming them unconsciously, and it feels a bit like you have been brainwashed.",
      "",
      "In China there are a lot of songs that have been named “divine songs”.",
      "For example, “Xiao Ping Guo”, “Zui Xuan Min Zu Feng”, “Ai Qing Mai Mai”, etc.",
      "Some people think these songs are repetitive with plain, boring lyrics.",
      "Others think these songs feel familiar, and are easy to sing along with.",
      ""
    ]
